"""BZT52C10S-7-F - 10 V zener diode, 200 mW, SOD-323 (Diodes Incorporated).

Datasheet: Diodes Incorporated BZT52C2V0S - BZT52C39S, DS30093 Rev. 20 - 2 (February 2017),
5 pages, LCSC C260895.

Electrical characteristics (p.2, TA = 25 C, BZT52C10S row): VZ 9.4 / 10 / 10.6 V at IZT 5 mA
(pulse test, note 6); ZZT 20 Ohm max at IZT; ZZK 150 Ohm max at IZK 1.0 mA; IR 0.1 uA max at
VR 7 V; temperature coefficient +4.5 to +8.0 mV/C at IZT. Marking WF.
Maximum ratings (p.2): VF 0.9 V max at IF 10 mA; PD 200 mW, RthJA 625 C/W (note 7); TJ, TSTG -65
to 150 C.
Package (p.4, SOD323): body 1.20-1.40 x 1.60-1.80 mm, 2.30-2.70 mm over the leads, 1.10 mm max
body (A2) plus 0.10 mm stand-off (A1). Suggested pad layout (p.4): X 0.590, Y 0.450, X1 2.700 mm.
Polarity (p.1): the band marks the cathode.

Pins: pad 1 cathode (K), pad 2 anode (A): KiCad's D_SOD-323 footprint numbers the cathode pad 1
and marks it with its silkscreen bar.

Packaged because the stdlib Zener generic cannot carry an MPN.
"""

A = io(Net)
K = io(Net)

Component(
    name="D",
    prefix="D",
    symbol=Symbol(library="BZT52C10S.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("D_SOD-323.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="BZT52C10S-7-F", manufacturer="Diodes Incorporated"),
    pins={
        "A": A,
        "K": K,
    },
    properties={
        "value": "10V zener",
        "zener_voltage_min": 9.4,  # V at IZT 5 mA
        "zener_voltage_max": 10.6,
        "reverse_current_max": 0.1e-6,  # A at 7 V
    },
    type="zener",
)
